<title>INDIA: TABLE-India TVS Electronics net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India TVS Electronics net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     17.86    vs   15.46</p>
<p>    Net sales	   1,144.6     vs  923.32</p>
<p>    Div (rupees)	    0.90    vs     N/A</p>
<p>    Other income	   18.49    vs   20.41</p>
<p>    Total expenditure 1,078.18    vs  858.68</p>
<p>    Interest costs	 44.12    vs   50.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   20.23    vs   19.05</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.7     vs    0.00</p>
<p>NOTE: TVS Electronics, a leading Indian computer peripherals manufacturer, said it continued to maintain its leadership position for the fourth consecutive year in the dot matrix printer segment.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
